# Patching & Systematic Updates [ZERO-REWRITE]

When implementing or fixing code, follow **`10-src/TOKEN-SAVING-AGENT-MANIFEST.md` §5**.

## Tags

| Tag | Rule |
|-----|------|
| `[PATCH-ONLY]` | Never reprint unchanged files. Output only unified diffs or localized blocks for changed lines. |
| `[CASCADE-UPDATE]` | External impact (exports, schemas, imports) → separate labeled block per path: `File: <verified-path>`. |
| `[REPORT-FORMAT]` | Delivery order: **SYSTEMATIC STATUS** → **TARGETED PATCHES** → **POST-EXECUTION REPORT**. |

## SYSTEMATIC STATUS

Bulleted changelog: modified, added, removed — no prose filler.

## TARGETED PATCHES

Line-specific blocks or minimal hunks. Label every cross-file block with its target path under `10-src/`, `apps/`, `libs/features/`, or `packages/`.

## POST-EXECUTION REPORT

Verify: Numbered-Functional paths, import cascade, `AGENT_TRACER.md` updated, no OOPs violations.
